==Trivia==
*This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Mareep|55}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Mareep|76}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Static Shock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Mareep|94}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

